# Everything under .claude/ is local by default: settings, hooks, task notes,
# keys and the knowledge-*.md rule mirrors that a local hook regenerates.
*
!.gitignore
!skills/
!skills/**

# Shared with every contributor. The repository is public: nothing here may
# name hosts, addresses, accounts or customers.
!rules/
rules/*
!rules/shared-*.md
!knowledge/
!knowledge/*.md
